<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V NEW ZEALAND SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V NEW ZEALAND SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>RAWALPINDI, Pakistan 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>fourth day of the second test between Pakistan and New Zealand</p>
<p>on Sunday:</p>
<p>New Zealnad first innings 249 (S.Fleming 67, L.Germon 55;</p>
<p>Mushtaq Ahmed 6-87, Mohammed Zahid 4-64)</p>
<p>Pakistan first innings 430 (Saeed Anwaqr 149, Ejaz Ahmed</p>
<p>125, Salim Malik 78; C.Cairns 5-137)</p>
<p>New Zealand second innings (overnight 69-0)</p>
<p> B.Young c Zahoor Elahi b Mohammed Zahid	    61</p>
<p> J.Vaughan lbw b Mohammed Zahid			 27</p>
<p> A.Parore lbw b Mohammad Zahid			   6</p>
<p> L.Germon b Mohammed Zahid				 0</p>
<p> N.Astle lbw b Mohammed Zahid			    1</p>
<p> M.Greatbatch c Saeed Anwar b Mushtaq Ahmad	 19</p>
<p> S.Fleming c Moin Khan b Shahid Nazir		  4</p>
<p> C.Cairns b Mushtaq Ahmed				 11</p>
<p> C.Harris lbw b Mohammed Zahid			  14</p>
<p> D.Patel lbw b Mohammed Zahid			    0</p>
<p> Simon Doull not out					 4</p>
<p> Extras (lb-7 nb-13 w-1)				  21</p>
<p> Total							 168</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-82 2-105 3-109 4-112 5-119 6-137 7-137</p>
<p>8-163</p>
<p>9-163</p>
<p>Bowling: Mohammed Zahid 20-3-66-7 (nb12 w1), Shahid Nazir</p>
