<p>(nb1),</p>
<p>Salim Malik 2-0-13-0.</p>
<p>Result: Pakistan won by an innings and 13 runs</p>
<p>First: Lahore - New Zealand won by 44 runs</p>
<p>Series drawn 1-1</p>
